  "ID": "37878",
  "post_title": "Veneración a Sant Josepet y a la SR Band en las fiestas del Camí Castelló, en Onda",
  "post_date": "2013-06-11 09:08:50",
  "post_name": "veneracion-a-sant-josepet-y-a-la-sr-band-en-las-fiestas-del-cami-castello-en-onda",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/06/IMG_2103.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Este lunes ha sido el turno de la parte religiosa de las fiestas del barrio Cam&iacute; Castell&oacute; y calles adyacentes, en Onda, con la procesi&oacute;n y misa en honor a Sant Josepet.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/06/IMG_2144.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La venerable parte l&uacute;dica la ha puesto por la noche la SR Band, que ha podido realizar su concierto, suspendido el viernes por la lluvia.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dillunsfestescamicastelloprocessoisrband/img_2053.jpg\" alt=\"img_2053\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dillunsfestescamicastelloprocessoisrband/img_2054.jpg\" alt=\"img_2054\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dillunsfestescamicastelloprocessoisrband/img_2055.jpg\" alt=\"img_2055\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dillunsfestescamicastelloprocessoisrband/img_2056.jpg\" alt=\"img_2056\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dillunsfestescamicastelloprocessoisrband/img_2057.jpg\" alt=\"img_2057\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dillunsfestescamicastelloprocessoisrband/img_2058.jpg\" alt=\"img_2058\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dillunsfestescamicastelloprocessoisrband/img_2059.jpg\" alt=\"img_2059\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f